{"product_id":"smok-ofrf-nexmesh-30w-pod-system","title":"SMOK OFRF NexMESH 30W Pod System","description":"\u003cp\u003eCheck out the SMOK OFRF NexMesh Pod Kit, featuring an integrated 1200mAh Rechargeable Battery, 5-30W range, and utilizes the NexMesh Coils to produce lots of vapor for MTL or DTL vaping. Constructed from lightweight aluminium alloy, the chassis of the OFRF NexMesh Pod Kit is impervious to light falls and drops. Featuring an adjustable wattage range between 5-30W, the OFRF can be paired with a 0.4ohm coil of either kanthal or stainless steel to produce a balanced maximum flavor and vapor output.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eQUICK LINK: \u003ca href=\"https:\/\/[YOUR DOMAIN]\/products\/smok-ofrf-nexmesh-replacement-coils\" title=\"SMOK OFRF Nex Mesh Replacement coil\"\u003eSMOK OFRF NexMESH Replacement Coils\u003c\/a\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eDisplaying pertinent information on the 0.69\" Screen, the NexMesh Pod Kit maintains a lofty 1200mAh rechargeable battery with a slew of protections to guard against failure. Connected by magnetic connection, the NexMesh Pod Kit can hold up to 2mL of eJuice within the side-filled pod and can accept coil changes from the bottom in a pressfit manner.\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eSMOK OFRF NexMesh Pod Kit Features:\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eCollaboration between SMOK \u0026amp; OFRF\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eDimensions - 80.5mm by 45mm by 17.5mm\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eIntegrated 1200mAh Rechargeable Battery\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eWattage Output Range: 5-30W\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eMax Voltage Output: 4.2V\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eResistance Range: 0.4ohm-3.0ohm\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eAluminium Alloy Chassis Construction\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eIntuitive Firing Button\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eTwo Adjustment Buttons\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e0.69\" Display Screen\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eMagnetic Pod Connection\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e2mL Refillable Pod Capacity\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eNexMesh Coil Series\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e0.4ohm SS316 Coil\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e0.4ohm Kanthal Coil\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003ePressFit Coil Installation\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eMagnetic Pod Connection\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eOver Time Protection\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eCheck Atomizer Protection\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eLow Resistance Protection\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eLow Battery Protection\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eOver Charge Protection\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eMicroUSB Port\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eIncludes:\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e1 NexMesh Pod Device\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e1 NexMesh Pod Cartridge\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e1 0.4ohm SS316 NexMesh Coil\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e1 0.4ohm Kanthal A1 NexMesh Coil\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e1 User Manual\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e1 MicroUSB Cable\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\u003c\/ul\u003e","brand":"SMOK","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":41775206891575,"sku":"S OFRF NexMESH Pod System","price":3900.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0599\/6799\/5959\/files\/smok_x_ofrf_nexmesh_30w_pod_kit_-_all_colors.jpg?v=1752511643","url":"https:\/\/[YOUR DOMAIN]\/products\/smok-ofrf-nexmesh-30w-pod-system","provider":"[YOUR BRAND]","version":"1.0","type":"link"}




